# 🧪 3️⃣ VALIDATORS (ЧИ ОДОО ХИЙЖ БАЙГАА ХЭСЭГ)

📁 **`src/validators/`**
👉 **ЭНД 4 ФАЙЛ БАЙХ ЁСТОЙ**

```
category.validator.ts
food.validator.ts
user.validator.ts
order.validator.ts
```

### 📄 `category.validator.ts`

```ts
import { z } from "zod";

export const createCategorySchema = z.object({
  name: z.string().min(1),
});

export const updateCategorySchema = z.object({
  name: z.string().min(1),
});
```

👉 **ЭНД ЮУ БИЧДЭГ ВЭ?**
➡️ `req.body` шалгалт
❌ DB ❌ res ❌ logic

---

# ⚙️ 4️⃣ SERVICES (DATABASE-ТЭЙ ЯРИХ ГАЗАР)

📁 **`src/services/`**

```
category.service.ts
food.service.ts
user.service.ts
order.service.ts
```

### 📄 `category.service.ts`

```ts
import { CategoryModel } from "../database/schema/category.schema.js";

export const createCategoryService = async (name: string) =>
  CategoryModel.create({ name });

export const getCategoryService = async (id: string) =>
  CategoryModel.findById(id);

export const getCategoriesService = async () =>
  CategoryModel.find();

export const updateCategoryService = async (id: string, name: string) =>
  CategoryModel.findByIdAndUpdate(id, { name }, { new: true });

export const deleteCategoryService = async (id: string) =>
  CategoryModel.findByIdAndDelete(id);
```

👉 **ЭНД ЮУ БИЧДЭГ ВЭ?**
➡️ Database logic
❌ req ❌ res ❌ validation

---

# 🧠 5️⃣ CONTROLLERS (REQUEST / RESPONSE)

📁 **`src/controllers/category/`**

```
create-category.ts
get-category.ts
get-categories.ts
update-category.ts
delete-category.ts
index.ts
```

### 📄 `create-category.ts`

```ts
import type { RequestHandler } from "express";
import { createCategorySchema } from "../../validators/category.validator.js";
import { createCategoryService } from "../../services/category.service.js";

export const createCategory: RequestHandler = async (req, res, next) => {
  try {
    const parsed = createCategorySchema.parse(req.body);
    const category = await createCategoryService(parsed.name);
    res.status(201).json(category);
  } catch (e) {
    next(e);
  }
};
```

👉 **ЭНД ЮУ БИЧДЭГ ВЭ?**
➡️ req авах
➡️ validator дуудах
➡️ service дуудах
➡️ res буцаах

---

# 🚪 6️⃣ ROUTES (URL ХОЛБОГЧ)

📁 **`src/routes/`**

### 📄 `category.router.ts`

```ts
import { Router } from "express";
import * as c from "../controllers/category/index.js";

const router = Router();

router.post("/", c.createCategory);
router.get("/", c.getCategories);
router.get("/:id", c.getCategory);
router.put("/:id", c.updateCategory);
router.delete("/:id", c.deleteCategory);

export default router;
```

👉 **ЭНД ЮУ БИЧДЭГ ВЭ?**
➡️ URL → аль controller вэ
❌ logic ❌ DB

---

# 🚨 7️⃣ MIDDLEWARE (ERROR)

📁 **`src/middlewares/`**

### 📄 `error-handler.ts`

```ts
import type { ErrorRequestHandler } from "express";
import { ZodError } from "zod";

export const errorHandler: ErrorRequestHandler = (err, req, res, next) => {
  if (err instanceof ZodError) {
    return res.status(400).json({ errors: err.issues });
  }
  res.status(500).json({ message: "Server error" });
};
```

---

# 🧩 8️⃣ `app.ts` ДЭЭР ЗААВАЛ ЭНЭ БАЙХ ЁСТОЙ

📄 **`src/app.ts`**

```ts
import categoryRouter from "./routes/category.router.js";
import { errorHandler } from "./middlewares/error-handler.js";

app.use("/categories", categoryRouter);

// 🔴 ХАМГИЙН СҮҮЛД
app.use(errorHandler);
```

---

# 🧠 ЭЦСИЙН 1 МӨР (ҮҮНИЙГ Л ЦЭЭЖИЛ)

> **schema = DB**
> **validator = body**
> **service = DB logic**
> **controller = req/res**
> **route = URL**
> **middleware = нийт app**

Хэрвээ одоо ч ойлгомжгүй байвал **ямар файл дээр, аль мөр дээр гацсанаа нэрлэ**.
ТЭР НЭГ ЦЭГИЙГ Л задлаад өгье.
